        <source>Customize the menu through the generated Semantic Part styles: first-level item text color and minimum height, item icon color, item text weight, group title weight, group list spacing, submenu item color, submenu list spacing, and the submenu popup frame border, corner radius and padding. The root element is customized through owner-scoped visual properties.</source>
